WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 4 — English subtitles (PRIMARY dialogue, language: en)

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Dad… who is Sara?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Where did you get this photo? Who gave it to you?

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Mama… from the message. Mama told me.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Your mother… loved you both. More than herself.

5
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Sara's mother died giving birth to her… and Sara went to her aunt.

6
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.000
And why did no one tell me? Why did I live 30 years alone?

7
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
We were afraid… afraid of losing you too.

8
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
You lost me… and you lost Sara.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Forgive me, my daughter… I'm tired of this secret.

10
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Someone's at the door…

11
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
I'm Sara… your sister.

12
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:08.000
I know you're Layla… Mama sent me a message too.
